Fix podop failing to start on python 3.14 with `RuntimeError: There is no current event loop in thread 'MainThread'`. 3.14 no longer lets `asyncio.get_event_loop()` create a loop when none is running; podop now creates one explicitly. Without it the postfix maps and the dovecot quota and sieve dicts were never served, so mail routing and quota enforcement were broken even though authentication still worked -- that path goes to the admin API directly since the lua migration.
